{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.poster.avif?t=1755943435\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.webm?t=1755943435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/cdaa8559e22f945428f7b0d871fe6aa9.mp4?t=1755943435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha Nomos is a rhythm based action rougelite that blends musical based mechanics with fast-paced hack and slash action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Cello and her gang escape a twisted world full of crazed puppets and a strange magical force called music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/48b4085061e150b81ae4d2da0f477dd4.avif?t=1755943435\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.poster.avif?t=1755943435\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.webm?t=1755943435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/8ebccc8e88ffdae86a302fdd692f9088.mp4?t=1755943435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use musical instruments to strike down your stuffed opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hit harde